# Environment secrets
# =========================
.env
.env.*
listen_v2/main/wifi_config.h
# runtime config: LAN IPs / webhook URLs (config.example.json is the template)
config.json
# runtime setting OVERRIDES, written by the server as knobs are tuned. Ignored
# for the same reason config.json is — it is per-install state, not source. The
# CATALOG (mcp-core/settings-spec.json) IS committed: it carries the defaults,
# ranges and documentation, so a fresh clone has every knob at its shipped value.
settings.json

